      "created_at": "2017-08-07T16:15:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If Shadows Flicker like Flame uses Insatiable Hunger of the Swarm, paying extra to target land with Dahan, and meets the threshold to repeat in an adjacet land, can you instead choose to repeat in a land with Dahan? &nbsp;Would you repay the cost, or does the initial payment affect the repeat as well?</p><p>We decided that the repeat is a seperate use and so you could apply shadows of the Dahan as long as you paid for it. &nbsp;</p>",
