      "created_at": "2017-08-07T16:58:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Arcanist Lupus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Arcanist Lupus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I don't have my cards with me for reference, but I thought that Land Thrashes also repeated on an adjacent land.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yes, The Land Thrashes in Furious Pain also repeats on an adjacent land.</p>\n<p>I think maybe Winds of Rust and Atrophy is the power Eric was looking for. Powerstorm would serve the same purpose.</p>",
